{
    "title": "Square Appointments: Scheduler",
    "description": "<b>Square Appointments</b> has everything you need to run your business from anywhere: <b>online booking</b>  that\u2019s easy for you and your customers, <b>a point of sale</b>  that tracks customer details, and a secure, fast <b>payments system</b> \u2014all in one place. There are three monthly plans: Free, Plus, and Premium, and each is on a per-location basis. Custom pricing is available for businesses that process over $250k in annual revenue.\r\n\r\n<b>Get 24/7 online booking, automatic appointment reminders, seamless payment processing</b>, and <b>no-show protection</b> with Square Appointments for Android.\r\n\r\n<b>Pricing Plans to Fit Your Business</b>\r\n\u2022 Pricing for Square Appointments is based on the features that fit your business best. There are three monthly plans: Free, Plus, and Premium, and each is on a per-location basis. Custom pricing is available for businesses that process over $250K in annual revenue.\r\n\r\n<b>Let Clients Book 24/7</b>\r\nNo website? No problem\u2014Square Appointments includes a free online booking site, so your customers can book anytime, from anywhere. Easily manage and accept bookings from the app on Android. And go to your Square Dashboard to turn on bookings with Google Search, Maps, Instagram, and more. With our Square Online integration, you can customize layouts, colors, and fonts that reflect your brand and even add pages for products, testimonials, and more. This feature is perfect for nail salons and barbershops looking to enhance their online presence.\r\n\u2022 Embed a booking widget or button on your existing website built outside of Square, or add a booking button to your email so clients can easily make bookings based on your availability.\r\n\r\n<b>Simplify Scheduling</b>\r\n\u2022 Square Assistant is a smart, automated messaging tool that replies to your clients on your behalf to confirm, cancel or reschedule appointments, 24/7.\r\n\u2022 Sync with your Google Calendar to automatically block personal events and avoid double bookings.\r\n\r\n<b>Seamlessly Check Out Clients</b>\r\n\u2022 Every calendar entry has a checkout button, so you can quickly and easily accept payments, sell products, or send invoices all from one app. Customers can allow Square to save their cards on file through their customer accounts for even faster checkouts and bookings.\r\n\u2022 Accept any kind of payment, including contactless and chip. All your sales are integrated into your POS.\r\n\r\n<b>Reduce No-Shows</b>\r\nClients get automated appointment reminders, and you can request prepayment or charge a cancellation fee for online booking. This is crucial for barbershops and nail salons where appointment slots are valuable.\r\n\r\n<b>Get To Know Your Clients</b>\r\n\u2022 Keep notes on all your clients so you can keep track of their preferences and appointments and sales history.\r\n\u2022 If you have customers in another database already, easily import them into Square Appointments and sync your calendar.\r\n\r\nSquare Appointments is made to fit any business, including Barbershops, hair salons, beauty salons, spas, nail salons, personal training, health and wellness, professional services, home repair, and cleaning services, tutoring services, and more.\r\n\r\nSquare Appointments turns your device into an appointment-scheduling powerhouse and mobile point-of-sale. This is more than just a calendar. Square Appointments is powerful appointment scheduling, a point of sale, and payment processing\u2014all in one place, making it an indispensable tool for barbershops, nail salons, and health & beauty businesses.\r\n\r\nReach Square Support by calling 1-855-700-6000 or reach us by mail at:\r\nBlock, Inc.\r\n1955 Broadway, Suite 600\r\nOakland, CA 94612",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Square Appointments</b> has everything you need to run your business from anywhere: <b>online booking</b>  that\u2019s easy for you and your customers, <b>a point of sale</b>  that tracks customer details, and a secure, fast <b>payments system</b> \u2014all in one place. There are three monthly plans: Free, Plus, and Premium, and each is on a per-location basis. Custom pricing is available for businesses that process over $250k in annual revenue.<br><br><b>Get 24/7 online booking, automatic appointment reminders, seamless payment processing</b>, and <b>no-show protection</b> with Square Appointments for Android.<br><br><b>Pricing Plans to Fit Your Business</b><br>\u2022 Pricing for Square Appointments is based on the features that fit your business best. There are three monthly plans: Free, Plus, and Premium, and each is on a per-location basis. Custom pricing is available for businesses that process over $250K in annual revenue.<br><br><b>Let Clients Book 24/7</b><br>No website? No problem\u2014Square Appointments includes a free online booking site, so your customers can book anytime, from anywhere. Easily manage and accept bookings from the app on Android. And go to your Square Dashboard to turn on bookings with Google Search, Maps, Instagram, and more. With our Square Online integration, you can customize layouts, colors, and fonts that reflect your brand and even add pages for products, testimonials, and more. This feature is perfect for nail salons and barbershops looking to enhance their online presence.<br>\u2022 Embed a booking widget or button on your existing website built outside of Square, or add a booking button to your email so clients can easily make bookings based on your availability.<br><br><b>Simplify Scheduling</b><br>\u2022 Square Assistant is a smart, automated messaging tool that replies to your clients on your behalf to confirm, cancel or reschedule appointments, 24/7.<br>\u2022 Sync with your Google Calendar to automatically block personal events and avoid double bookings.<br><br><b>Seamlessly Check Out Clients</b><br>\u2022 Every calendar entry has a checkout button, so you can quickly and easily accept payments, sell products, or send invoices all from one app. Customers can allow Square to save their cards on file through their customer accounts for even faster checkouts and bookings.<br>\u2022 Accept any kind of payment, including contactless and chip. All your sales are integrated into your POS.<br><br><b>Reduce No-Shows</b><br>Clients get automated appointment reminders, and you can request prepayment or charge a cancellation fee for online booking. This is crucial for barbershops and nail salons where appointment slots are valuable.<br><br><b>Get To Know Your Clients</b><br>\u2022 Keep notes on all your clients so you can keep track of their preferences and appointments and sales history.<br>\u2022 If you have customers in another database already, easily import them into Square Appointments and sync your calendar.<br><br>Square Appointments is made to fit any business, including Barbershops, hair salons, beauty salons, spas, nail salons, personal training, health and wellness, professional services, home repair, and cleaning services, tutoring services, and more.<br><br>Square Appointments turns your device into an appointment-scheduling powerhouse and mobile point-of-sale. This is more than just a calendar. Square Appointments is powerful appointment scheduling, a point of sale, and payment processing\u2014all in one place, making it an indispensable tool for barbershops, nail salons, and health &amp; beauty businesses.<br><br>Reach Square Support by calling 1-855-700-6000 or reach us by mail at:<br>Block, Inc.<br>1955 Broadway, Suite 600<br>Oakland, CA 94612",
